msgstr "删除资料库…"

msgid "Escape"
msgstr "Esc"

msgid "Every Pro feature is on. Thank you."
msgstr "所有 Pro 功能均已开启。谢谢。"

msgid "Everything in the Trash is deleted for good. This can't be undone."
msgstr "回收站中的所有内容都将被永久删除，此操作无法撤销。"

msgid "Everything in your library goes: boards, lists, items, images, drafts and backups. Export first if you want a copy. Your settings and licence stay."
msgstr "资料库中的所有内容都会被删除：看板、列表、片段、图片、草稿和备份。如果需要副本，请先导出。你的设置和许可证会保留。"

msgid "Export library"
msgstr "导出资料库"

msgid "Fetches each site's small icon from the site itself. Off by default, so no request is made."
msgstr "从网站本身获取每个网站的小图标。默认关闭，因此不会发出请求。"

msgid "Fields"
msgstr "字段"

msgid "File"
msgstr "文件"

msgid "Fill in template"
msgstr "填写模板"

msgid "Fixes the panel against one edge of the screen, on the monitor it is on. Floating lets it sit anywhere."
msgstr "将面板固定在其所在显示器的某条屏幕边缘。选择“浮动”则可放在任意位置。"

msgid "Floating"
msgstr "浮动"

msgid "Follow Windows"
msgstr "跟随 Windows"

