msgstr "请为看板命名。"

msgid "Give the list a name."
msgstr "请为列表命名。"

msgid "Green"
msgstr "绿色"

msgid "Hidden in lists until you hold Space, kept out of clipboard history, and cleared from the clipboard {} seconds after you use it."
msgstr "在按住空格键之前在列表中隐藏，不计入剪贴板历史，并在使用后 {} 秒从剪贴板中清除。"

msgid "Hidden. Hold Space to reveal."
msgstr "已隐藏。按住空格键即可显示。"

msgid "Hidden. Open it in the Panel to reveal."
msgstr "已隐藏。在面板中打开即可显示。"

msgid "Hover"
msgstr "悬停"

msgid "Hover and click"
msgstr "悬停和点击"

msgid "Hover delay"
msgstr "悬停延迟"

msgid "How long the pointer rests on the strip before the panel opens, from 0 to {} milliseconds."
msgstr "指针停在细条上多久后面板展开，范围为 0 至 {} 毫秒。"

msgid "How long the pointer stays off the open panel before it folds away, from 0 to {} milliseconds."
msgstr "指针离开已展开的面板多久后面板收起，范围为 0 至 {} 毫秒。"

msgid "How wide the panel opens, from {} to {} pixels."
msgstr "面板展开的宽度，范围为 {} 至 {} 像素。"

msgid "Image"
msgstr "图片"

msgid "In these programs Snipdeck copies instead of pasting. Use the program's file name, for example notepad.exe."
msgstr "在这些程序中，Snipdeck 会复制而不是粘贴。请使用程序的文件名，例如 notepad.exe。"

