msgstr "在链接上显示网站图标"

msgid "Slate"
msgstr "石板灰"

msgid "Snipdeck"
msgstr "Snipdeck"

msgid "Snipdeck Pro"
msgstr "Snipdeck Pro"

msgid "Snipdeck handle, press the Panel hotkey to open"
msgstr "Snipdeck 拉手，按面板快捷键即可展开"

msgid "Snipdeck has no account, no server and no telemetry, and it opens no network port. Nothing you save leaves this PC."
msgstr "Snipdeck 没有账户、没有服务器、没有遥测，也不开放任何网络端口。你保存的内容不会离开这台电脑。"

msgid "Snipdeck saves a copy of your library once a day and keeps the newest 7. Restoring adds back what is missing and never removes anything."
msgstr "Snipdeck 每天保存一份资料库副本，并保留最新的 7 份。还原只会补回缺少的内容，不会删除任何东西。"

msgid "Snipdeck waits in the tray so the shortcuts work after you sign in."
msgstr "Snipdeck 会待在系统托盘中，以便登录后快捷键仍可使用。"

msgid "Snippets"
msgstr "片段"

msgid "Sort items by"
msgstr "排序方式"

msgid "Start with Windows"
msgstr "随 Windows 启动"

msgid "Tab"
msgstr "Tab"

msgid "Tag"
msgstr "标签"

