msgstr "该密钥用于打开你之前保存的导出文件中的加密项目。如果忘记它，这些项目将永远无法再打开。"

msgid "The list and its {} items move to the Trash. You can restore them for {} days."
msgstr "该列表及其中的 {} 个片段将移至回收站。你可以在 {} 天内恢复它们。"

msgid "The one setting that can make a network request is website icons. It is off unless you turn it on above."
msgstr "唯一可能发出网络请求的设置是网站图标。除非你在上方开启，否则它是关闭的。"

msgid "The selected items are deleted for good. This can't be undone."
msgstr "所选片段将被永久删除，此操作无法撤销。"

msgid "The tag is removed from its items. The items themselves stay."
msgstr "标签将从其片段中移除，片段本身保留。"

msgid "The time now"
msgstr "当前时间"

msgid "Theme"
msgstr "主题"

msgid "This board"
